Tape-parity golden snapshots for the AC.2 acceptance gate.

Each file here is a minimal JSON summary of a parsed tape's
structural shape — generated on first run of `tape_parity.rs` and
compared byte-for-byte thereafter. Regenerate by deleting the
affected files and re-running the test suite.

Directory layout:
  json/       — JSON grammar goldens (canada, twitter, citm_catalog, data, data_xl)
  css_l4/     — CSS L4 goldens (bootstrap, normalize, tailwind, test_import)
  bbnf/       — BBNF self-hosted goldens (bbnf, expressions, types)
  sheets/     — Google Sheets goldens (simple, nested_if, arithmetic)
  ebnf/       — EBNF goldens (minimal, expr, recursive_list)
